     - (b) Enthalpy: $\boxed{48.2 \text{ kJ/kg dry air}}$ (unchanged, as enthalpy is independent of pressure for ideal gases)  
     - (c) Relative humidity: $\boxed{54.1\%}$ (unchanged, as relative humidity is a ratio and not directly pressure-dependent)  
     - (d) Dew-point temperature: $\boxed{12.3°\text{C}}$ (unchanged, as dew-point depends on vapor pressure, not total pressure)  
     - (e) Specific volume: $\boxed{1.22 \text{ m}^3/\text{kg dry air}}$ (increases due to lower pressure)  

