Δt = Δt' * √(1 - v^2/c^2)
Δt = 3 years * √(1 - (0.6c)^2/c^2)
Δt = 3 years * √(1 - 0.36)
Δt = 3 years * √(0.64)
Δt = 3 years * 0.8
Δt = 2.4 years

